rewards.message:
{Treasure Chest}

You take the supplies stored in the chest. Your hero receives 5 units of a random resource.

You could instead study the old tomes to improve one of your skills.

{Treasure Chest}

The tomes teach the art of war. Your hero's Attack increases by 1.

You could instead take the supplies from the chest.

{Treasure Chest}

The tomes teach the art of defense. Your hero's Defense increases by 1.

You could instead take the supplies from the chest.

{Treasure Chest}

The tomes teach the secrets of magic. Your hero's Spell Power increases by 1.

You could instead take the supplies from the chest.

{Treasure Chest}

The tomes broaden your understanding of the world. Your hero's Knowledge increases by 1.

You could instead take the supplies from the chest.
